    <briefdescription>
<para>Preprocessor macros to convert <computeroutput>__DATE__</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>__TIME__</computeroutput> macros into numeric values for the RTC. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file is a utility that allows setting the RTC clock time automatically to the time when the program was compiled. No modification is necessary.</para>
<para>Example of <computeroutput>__DATE__:</computeroutput> &quot;Jul 22 2024&quot;</para>
<para>Example of <computeroutput>__TIME__:</computeroutput> &quot;18:30:00&quot;</para>
